  "goodToKnow": "Die Rubrik is a section or category, in newspapers (die Rubrik Sport, Leserbriefe), on websites and in forms (box, column). It comes from Latin ruber (red), because medieval scribes wrote headings in red ink. In English, rubric means instructions or a marking scheme, which is different. Stressed on the second syllable: ru-BREEK. The Rubik's Cube is der Zauberwürfel. Plural: die Rubriken."
